# Development only. NEVER put a bot token here: the token stays on the server.
# Optional: where `npm run dev` proxies /api (default http://127.0.0.1:4000)
# VITE_BACKEND_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4000
# Optional, DEVELOPMENT in a normal browser (no Telegram): a signed initData produced by `npm run miniapp:dev-initdata` in the backend.
# It is only honoured by `vite dev` (import.meta.env.DEV); production builds ignore it.
# VITE_DEV_INIT_DATA=
